sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Share the gateway without sharing route ownership
accDescr: The network owner shares its gateway and enables automatic acceptance, then staging creates VPC attachments while the owner controls transit-gateway routing.
participant Net as Network account
participant Stage as Staging account
Net->>Stage: RAM share of existing transit gateway
Note over Net: Auto acceptance and approved TGW routing
Stage->>Net: Create attachment from staging VPC
Net-->>Stage: Attachment automatically accepted
Note over Stage: Configure staging VPC routes
Note over Net: Own TGW associations and route tables
